---
import PageLayout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const lastUpdated = '2026-09-06';
const lastUpdatedDisplay = new Date(lastUpdated).toLocaleDateString('en-US', {
  year: 'numeric',
  month: 'long',
  day: 'numeric',
});

const metadata = {
  title: 'IP Policy',
  description: "Senpai's intellectual property and DMCA takedown policy.",
};

// TODO(founder), blocking: register a designated DMCA agent with the U.S.
// Copyright Office (see https://www.copyright.gov/dmca-directory/) and
// replace the {{DMCA_AGENT_NAME}} / {{DMCA_AGENT_ADDRESS}} tokens below
// with the real registered name and address. A takedown policy without a
// properly registered agent doesn't confer DMCA safe-harbor protection.
// Have legal review this whole page before it goes live.
---

<PageLayout metadata={metadata}>
  <section aria-labelledby="ip-heading" class="page-wrap legal">
    <h1 id="ip-heading" class="h2">Intellectual Property Policy</h1>
    <p class="caption2 updated">Last updated: {lastUpdatedDisplay}</p>

    <p class="caption1">
      Senpai respects the intellectual property rights of others, including anime and manga rights holders, and
      expects the same from everyone who uses the app — including content made in Create and any avatar built in
      Senpai.
    </p>

    <h2 class="title2">Reporting infringement</h2>
    <p class="caption1">
      If you believe content on Senpai infringes your copyright, send a notice to our designated agent under the
      Digital Millennium Copyright Act (DMCA):
    </p>
    <p class="caption1 agent">
      {'{{DMCA_AGENT_NAME}}'}<br />
      Makeshift Software Inc.<br />
      {'{{DMCA_AGENT_ADDRESS}}'}<br />
      <a href="mailto:team@senpaiapp.com">team@senpaiapp.com</a>
    </p>
    <p class="caption1">
      Your notice should identify the copyrighted work, the material you believe infringes it, and how to contact
      you, along with a statement made under penalty of perjury that you're authorized to act on the rights
      holder's behalf.
    </p>

    <h2 class="title2">Counter-notice</h2>
    <p class="caption1">
      If your content was removed and you believe that was a mistake, you may submit a counter-notice to the same
      contact identifying the removed content and why you believe it doesn't infringe.
    </p>

    <h2 class="title2">Repeat infringers</h2>
    <p class="caption1">We terminate the accounts of users found to be repeat infringers.</p>
  </section>
</PageLayout>

<style>
  .legal {
    max-width: 720px;
  }
  .legal h2 {
    margin-top: 32px;
  }
  .legal p {
    margin-top: 12px;
  }
  .agent {
    padding: 16px 20px;
    background: var(--panel);
    border-radius: 2px;
  }
  .updated {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .legal a {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
</style>
